-- statement:
--   **The seven-pass machine computes the `B` line pass** (round-six regime).
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegSw4`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.r6_machine (P : Prm) (hP : P.Ok) : ∃ n₁ : ℕ, ∀ n, n₁ ≤ n → ∀ src : ℕ → ℕ,
--       SrcOK6 P n src → ∀ D : ℕ, dP6 P n = D + 1 →
--       ∀ [∀ i, NeZero (sD6 src D i)] [∀ i, NeZero (tD6 P n D i)],
--       ∀ ys : List GI, ys.length = (List.ofFn (tD6 P n D)).prod →
--         pipeSweep (pipe6 P n src D) (D + 1) ys =
--           tensorGo (mapsLine6 P n src D) (List.ofFn (tD6 P n D)) ys
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** B-line machine, sweep 4: the machine computes `tensorGo mapsLine6`
--
--   * **`pipeSweep`**: the machine applies an axis program `Fp k` for `k = 0, 1, …` in place;
--   * **`pipeSweep_eq`**: if every `Fp k` is the in-place axis map of `F k`, the machine is `sweepL`;
--   * **`sweepL_tensorGo'`**: `sweepL` of line maps of slice form is `tensorGo`;
--   * **`r6_maps_eq`**: in the round-six regime `mapsLine6 = mapsBs` and `λ ∣ t_i`, `s_i < t_i`;
--   * **`r6_machine`**: in the round-six regime, the seven-pass machine (`pipe6`, axes `0..d-1`)
--     computes `tensorGo (mapsLine6 P n src D)` on every array of the right length.
--
